  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（めぐるがため息をつくなんて珍しいな……）",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐる、どうかしたのか？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あ、プロデューサー！\r\n実はね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "学校の友だちがケンカしちゃったんだ\r\n二人とも、すっごく仲が良かったのに……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどな。でもなんで、めぐるが落ち込んでるんだ？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だってきっと、本当は仲直りしたいと思うんだ\r\nそう思うと、悲しくなっちゃって……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "仲直りは難しそうなのか？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うーん……変な意地を張ってて、\r\nどうしようもないって感じなんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしは早くお互い謝ったほうがいいって思うんだけど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "でも……これは二人の問題だから、\r\nわたしが首を突っ込んで迷惑かけちゃうのも嫌なの",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "こういう時、\r\nどうすればいいのかなー……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（友達思いなめぐるらしい悩みだな）",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐる、そんなときは……",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "めぐるが\r\n何とかしてあげよう",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "二人を信じて\r\n見守ってあげればいい",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "強行突破だ！",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐるが感じた気持ちを、\r\nそれぞれに話してあげるんだ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしから……でも……\r\nおせっかいだって嫌がられないかな？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐるの、本気で二人の力になりたいって思いは、\r\nきっと伝わるはずだよ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だって、めぐるから話を聞いた俺でも\r\n友だちへの思いが伝わったんだから",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "相手のために、ときには一歩を踏み出すのも\r\n友だちの役目だ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そっか……\r\nそうだよね！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへ！　プロデューサーに相談してよかったよ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたし……二人がまた仲良くなるために、\r\n一番いいと思うことをやってみる！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、めぐるの気持ちが伝われば、\r\nきっとうまくいくさ！",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ありがとうプロデューサー！\r\n頑張ってみるね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030140,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "でも……それだけでいいのかな……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "二人が本当にめぐるが言うような\r\n仲の良い友だちだとしたら",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "きっと二人だけで仲直りできると思うぞ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そうだね……信じることも大切だよね",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "どうなっちゃうのかは分からないのは怖いけど……\r\nでもわたし、プロデューサーの言葉を信じてみるよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "二人とも、ちゃんと仲直りしてくれるといいな……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "でも大丈夫だよね、きっと\r\nだって、友だちだもん……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー、\r\nもしケンカが続いちゃったら、また相談に乗ってくれる？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、いつでも言ってくれ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへ、頼りにしてるからね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030220,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "強行突破？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、ちょっと強引かもしれないけど、\r\n二人が仲直りできる場所を、めぐるが作ってあげるんだ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030230,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "でも、わたしが余計なことをして\r\nもっと仲が悪くなっちゃったら……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ケンカが長引いてもいいことなんてない\r\nめぐるだって早く仲直りしてほしいだろ？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐるが動けば、\r\nきっと二人も分かってくれるさ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030240,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……そうだね",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー、\r\nわたしちょっと怖がってたのかも",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030260,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "二人の仲が変にこじれちゃったらどうしようって……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030270,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "でも、仲良くなってほしいなら\r\n自分から話さなくちゃ、だよね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうやって人のことを考えて動けるところ、\r\nめぐるのいいところだと思うぞ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030280,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030290,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……わたし、やってみるよ！\r\n二人のために、わたしができることを！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300403/2003004030290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、また何か困ったことがあったら、\r\nいつでも俺に相談してくれ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004030300,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん……\r\nありがとう、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
